---
source: route.rs
expression: "render(index_page, Origin::Node { url: \"http://127.0.0.1:8080\".to_owned() })"
---
<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><title>intxt</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/tailwind.css"/><style>.intxt-page{max-width:48rem;margin:0 auto;padding:0 1rem 3rem}.intxt-page ul,.intxt-page ol{padding:0;list-style:none}.intxt-page li{padding:.5rem 0}.intxt-page h2{font-size:1.125rem;font-weight:600;margin:1.5rem 0 .5rem}.intxt-markdown p{margin:.5rem 0}.intxt-markdown pre{overflow-x:auto}.intxt-page code,.intxt-page pre{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:.875em}.intxt-commit{margin:.5rem 0}.intxt-commit-message{white-space:pre-wrap;margin:.25rem 0}.intxt-diff{overflow-x:auto;border:1px solid var(--df-color-border,#ccc);padding:.5rem 0;margin:.5rem 0}.intxt-diff span{display:block;padding:0 .75rem;white-space:pre}.diff-file{font-weight:600}.diff-hunk{background:rgba(127,127,255,.15)}.diff-added{background:rgba(46,160,67,.2)}.diff-removed{background:rgba(248,81,73,.2)}.intxt-muted{font-size:.875rem}.intxt-thread{border-left:2px solid var(--df-color-border,#ccc);padding-left:.75rem;margin:1rem 0}.intxt-comment{margin:.5rem 0}.intxt-comment p{margin:.25rem 0;white-space:pre-wrap}.intxt-quote{border-left:2px solid var(--df-color-border,#ccc);margin:.25rem 0;padding-left:.5rem}.intxt-page a{color:inherit}</style></head><body class="bg-canvas text-text"><div class="intxt-page"><header class="h-14 shrink-0 gap-2 px-2 text-text data-[state=bare]:pl-4" data-state="bare" style="display:flex;align-items:center;min-width:0;position:relative;z-index:var(--df-layer-app-bar)"><h2 style="flex:1 1 0;min-width:0" class="m-0 truncate text-lg font-semibold">intxt</h2></header><main><p>A read-only viewer of intxts, served at <code>/i/&#60;drawer id&#62;?via=&#60;node key&#62;</code>.</p><p>Reading intxts from the node at <code>http://127.0.0.1:8080</code>.</p></main></div></body></html>
